        rdfs:comment                   "On loan to Houghton Hall."@en , "Wing armchair, with cabriole legs, terminating in square hoofed feet; rectangular back; the wings with S profiled elevation are canted out from the back and run down into out-curving arms ending in scrolls.  Covered in green velvet."@en , "Wing armchair, walnut and parcel-gilt, with green velvet cover trimmed with silk braid, attributed to the Roberts family, Britain, ca. 1720"@en ;
